window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Sanctuary is more than a band—it's a home for the lost and broken.</b></p> <p>No one knows that better than Ryker, the lead singer of the newly rising rock band. It seems he is unable to go even one day without being in the spotlight, and not always for good reasons. From run-ins with his label to arrests and a long line of broken hearts, it seems this rock god is determined to enjoy fame.</p> <p>Fox, on the other hand, Sanctuary's infamous guitarist, is the perfect, quintessential rocker in the public's eye. Only ever seen when flirting and playing with his lead singer, earning the title of rock and roll's off-limits rebel. It's no surprise that these guys have taken the world by storm, and it isn't just for their music, but also their risqué behavior when they perform on stage.</p> <p>The playboy and the bad boy.</p> <p>Is it all a game?</p> <p>An act for the fans?</p> <p>Tune in to our live coverage of their performance tonight and find out.</p> <p>Long may he resist…or not.</p>"; 
